7. destination_availability_locked destination_availability_alpha -> from load destination payload (locked) and remains after unload.

8. destination_node_occupied destination_node_alpha -> from load destination payload (occupied) and remains after unload.

9. destination_node_ready destination_node_alpha -> from unload destination payload.

10. dispatch_allocated origin_availability_alpha -> from allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate.

11. dispatch_ready destination_availability_alpha -> from mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready.

12. dispatch_ready origin_availability_alpha -> from mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready.

13. dispatch_slot_available dispatch_slot_alpha -> after executing both dispatches (origin and shift) we will have slot available.

14. dispatched origin_availability_alpha -> from execute_origin_dispatch.

15. dispatched shift_candidate_alpha -> from execute_schedule_dispatch.

16. origin_availability_confirmed origin_availability_alpha -> from unload origin payload.

17. origin_availability_locked origin_availability_alpha -> from load origin payload (remains after unload).

18. origin_node_occupied origin_node_alpha -> from load origin payload (remains after unload).

19. origin_node_ready origin_node_alpha -> from activate origin node (and remains after load/unload? Activate sets origin_node_ready true; load does not affect; unload does not affect; so remains true).

