- confirm_candidate_preparedness: effect adds candidate_prepared. No negative.

- load_destination_payload: effect adds destination_node_occupied, destination_availability_locked, destination_payload_linked, not cargo_available. So removes cargo_available. That's okay; we will later unload to restore.

- unload_destination_payload: effect adds destination_node_ready, destination_availability_confirmed, cargo_available, not destination_payload_linked. So removes destination_payload_linked (not in goal) and adds cargo_available. Good.

- detach_task_profile: effect adds route_task_profile_available, not candidate_task_profile_linked. So removes candidate_task_profile_linked (which we may need for goal). So we must be careful not to detach after we have set the goal link for destination. We'll detach only from origin and maybe from destination before reattachment.

- load_origin_payload: effect adds origin_node_occupied, origin_availability_locked, origin_payload_linked, not cargo_available.

- unload_origin_payload: effect adds origin_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, cargo_available, not origin_payload_linked.

- assemble_transport_leg: effect adds transport_leg_assigned, transport_leg_origin_linked, transport_leg_destination_linked, not transport_leg_available. No other removals.

- release_compliance_certificate: effect adds compliance_certificate_available, not candidate_compliance_certificate_linked. So removes the link (not in goal). Good.

- authorize_transport_leg_loading: effect adds transport_leg_loading_authorized. No negative.

- mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready: effect adds dispatch_ready ?origin_availability. No negative.

- allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate: effect adds dispatch_allocated ?candidate, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?candidate ?dispatch_slot, not dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot. So removes dispatch_slot_available.

- execute_origin_dispatch: effect adds dispatched ?origin_availability, vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit, dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot. No negative.

- mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready: effect adds dispatch_ready ?destination_availability. No negative.

- execute_destination_dispatch: not needed.

- create_candidate: adds candidate_created, not (not candidate_created) etc. Not needed.

- allocate_vehicle_unit: adds vehicle_allocated, candidate_vehicle_linked, not vehicle_available. Not needed.

- assign_operator_resource: adds candidate_operator_linked, not operator_available. Not needed.

- release_operator_resource: adds operator_available, not candidate_operator_linked.

- assign_skill_certificate: adds candidate_skill_certificate_linked, not skill_certificate_available.

- release_skill_certificate: adds skill_certificate_available, not candidate_skill_certificate_linked.

- assign_compliance_certificate: adds candidate_compliance_certificate_linked, not compliance_certificate_available.

- release_compliance_certificate: we will use.

- activate_origin_node: adds origin_node_ready. No negative.

- lock_origin_availability: adds origin_availability_locked, origin_availability_confirmed. No negative.

- activate_destination_node: adds destination_node_ready.

- lock_destination_availability: adds destination_availability_locked, destination_availability_confirmed.

- assemble_origin_loaded_leg etc: not needed.

- load_container_onto_leg etc: not needed.

