Now we need to mark origin and destination dispatch ready. Mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready requires origin_availability_locked, origin_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_loading_authorized, not dispatch_ready origin. Similarly for destination.

